
    @startuml
    !include common/pcpi_theme.puml
    title Figure 1. End-to-end candidate-only confirmation workflow
    left to right direction

    rectangle "Prospectively frozen archive
and candidate-selection rule" as freeze #E8F1FB
    rectangle "Observed archive member
and selected candidate" as candidate #F7FBFF
    rectangle "Sequential candidate-only
confirmation experiment" as experiment #EEF6EA
    rectangle "Positive certificate
or undecided outcome" as outcome #FFF7E8
    rectangle "Evidence artefact
(hash, counts, replay inputs,
bounds, stopping state)" as artefact #F7FBFF
    rectangle "Independent statistical replay" as replay #EEF6EA
    rectangle "Bounded trust claim:
replay checks the reported statistical path
but does not authenticate the simulator
or validate the model" as trust #FFF2F2

    freeze --> candidate
    candidate --> experiment
    experiment --> outcome
    outcome --> artefact
    artefact --> replay
    replay --> trust

    note bottom of outcome
    Distinguish a positive certificate from an undecided result.
    end note
    @enduml
